        <briefdescription>
<para>Replaces a file with new bytes, through a hidden temporary file in the same folder. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When the target exists, the temporary file takes the metadata of the target. The final step is one replace, so a reader sees the old bytes or the new bytes.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>targetFile</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Destination file to create or overwrite. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>bytes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Raw bytes to write.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Result indicating write and replace success or failure. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
